{
  "info": {
    "name": "DOS Controller API (multi-worker)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Client-facing and internal controller API (phase 3). Start the stack with `docker compose up -d --build` (1 controller + 4 workers). Run 'Upload text object' first: its test saves {{objectId}}. 'List workers' saves the first worker's ID into {{workerId}}. Saved example responses for unchanged requests were captured from the phase 2 stack."
  },
